'''Darkness''' is a stacking [[debuff]] dealing increasingly high [[damage type|darkness]] [[damage over time]]. It occurs in the [[Azurite Mine]] when a character moves outside the [[Delve#Light and Darkness|lit]] areas of the mine. The debuff deals damage equal to 2% of the player's life and energy shield per second,{{Confirm|3.5.0 change}} gaining a stack every 0.25 seconds (maximum 5000 stacks). Stepping into a lit area clears the debuff. 

==Mechanics==
Darkness stacks every 0.25 seconds up to a maximum of 5000 stacks.
Each stack deals 2% of your eHP per second.{{Confirm|3.5.0 change}} (0.5% at 75% darkness resistance). Without any mitigation or regeneration you will die in darkness at 20 stacks (5 seconds). First second you will miss 5% ehp, then - 18%, 39%, 68% and 105% at the 5 second.

At 0% darkness resistance if regeneration is applied to Life pool it will produce (1 / 1516) of health degeneration per stack. The cap will be at 1516 darkness stacks with 1 eHP or so.

If regeneration is applied to energy shield instead, the degen will produce (ES / eHP / 1516) of degen per stack. The cap will be at 1137 stacks with 4 eHP (3 ES) character.

'''Note:''' the current hidden degen mechanic cannot be ''mitigated'' by any % life regen. But (as well as the main Darkness damage) it can be mitigated by reduced damage taken over time modifiers such as [[The Pantheon#Major gods|Arakaali's pantheon]], [[Crafting Bench|crafted]] mod {{c|mod|% reduced Damage taken from Damage Over Time}}, by [[Mind over Matter]] keystone (*1.4) and {{il|Kintsugi}} body armour (*1.35).

In order to calculate number of stacks which you can handle with your regeneration use formula: "maximum stacks = (all the mitigations) * regeneration * 50 / eHP "

